s the bold. The horizon, as always, was just the beginning.\n\nthe pilot Anya was packed before Alex Quinn finished reading the note. 'Where to?' the pilot Anya asked. Alex Quinn pointed at the map's edge, past the lost city of Zal, past everything known. 'There,' Alex Quinn said."}]}

